<title>USA: Wyser-Pratte seeks meeting with Rexene holders.</title>
<headline>Wyser-Pratte seeks meeting with Rexene holders.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wyser-Pratte &amp; Co Inc said Thursday it and another investor had mailed definitive solicitation materials seeking the call of a special meeting to all shareholders of Rexene Corp.</p>
</text>
